0 pl-0 flex-col gap-4\">\n        <div className=\"font-semibold text-primary text-[13px] leading-[17px]\">\n          ESSAY / ATTENTION\n        </div>\n        <h1 className=\"font-[family-name:Source_Serif_4] font-bold text-[32px] leading-[42px]\">\n          The Quiet Work of Paying Attention\n        </h1>\n        <p className=\"font-[family-name:Source_Serif_4] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[31px]\">\n          In an age of acceleration, noticing has become a radical form of care.\n        </p>\n        <div className=\"font-semibold text-[#5e5e58] text-[13px] leading-[17px]\">\n          By Mara Ellison · October 12, 2024 · 18 min read\n        </div>\n      </header>\n      <div className=\"bg-[#fff1c2] text-[#5e5e58] flex pt-6 pr-6 pb-6 pl-6 flex-col gap-4\">\n        <p className=\"font-[family-name:Source_Serif_4] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[31px]\">\n          “The world does not become richer when we move faster through it.”\n        </p>\n        <p className=\"font-semibold text-[#5e5e58] text-[13px] leading-[17px]\">\n          — Simone Weil\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n        <p className=\"font-normal text-[18px] leading-[23px]\">\n          There is a particular kind of tiredness that arrives when every moment\n          has been accounted for. It is not the tiredness of work, exactly, but\n          of being asked to witness everything at once.\n        </p>\n        <p className=\"font-normal text-[18px] leading-[23px]\">\n          Attention asks for less. It asks us to stay with the cup cooling\n          beside the book, the late light gathering on the floor, the sentence\n          we almost skipped.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"bg-primary w-12 h-1\" />\n      <section className=\"flex flex-col gap-6\">\n        <h2 className=\"font-[family-name:Source_Serif_4] font-semibold text-[24px] leading-[31px]\">\n          A practice of staying\n        </h2>\n        <p className=\"font-normal text-[18px] leading-[23px]\">\n          To pay attention is not to collect more impressions. It is to let one\n          impression become precise.\n        </p>\n        <p className=\"font-normal text-[18px] leading-[23px]\">\n          The ordinary is not waiting to be made extraordinary. It is waiting to\n          be met without haste.\n        </p>\n      </section>\n      <footer className=\"border-x-border border-t border-t-border border-b-border flex pt-6 flex-col gap-6\">\n        <div className=\"font-semibold text-[13px] leading-[17px] flex justify-between items-center\">\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"text-[#5e5e58]\">\n            ← Previous essay\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"text-[#5e5e58]\">\n            Save for later\n          </a>\n          <a href=\"#\" className=\"text-[#5e5e58]\">\n            Next essay →\n          </a>\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n    </article>\n    <aside className=\"flex sticky top-8 self-start flex-col gap-6 w-48 h-fit\">\n      <div className=\"font-semibold text-[13px] leading-[17px]\">CONTENTS</div>\n      <nav className=\"flex flex-col gap-4\">\n        <a\n          href=\"#\"\n          className=\"font-semibold text-primary text-[13px] leading-[17px]\"\n        >\n          A practice of staying\n        </a>\n        <a\n          href=\"#\"\n          className=\"font-semibold text-[#5e5e58] text-[13px] leading-[17px]\"\n        >\n          The cost of speed\n        </a>\n        <a\n          href=\"#\"\n          className=\"font-semibold text-[#5e5e58] text-[13px] leading-[17px]\"\n        >\n          Learning to look\n        </a>\n      </nav>\n      <div className=\"bg-border relative w-1 h-48\">\n        <div className=\"bg-primary absolute top-0 left-0 w-1 h-[38%]\" />\n      </div>\n    </aside>\n  </main>\n</div>;",
